    "body": "I think there is an [ongoing effort](https://github.com/WebKit/explainers/tree/main/animation-frame-rate#javascript-animations) to replace `requestAnimationFrame` with Web Animations, along with allowing control of the frame rate of these animations from there. Maybe that would be a good place to add such an API? cc @smfr \r\n\r\n\r\nPs: I've been made aware that online behavioral research would be another area where such an API would be very useful, currently measuring response time is very hard.",
